```typescript
const outcome = await state.runtime.execute({ type: "prompt", text: line });
if (outcome.status === "failed" || outcome.status === "commit_failed") {
  stderr.write(`${outcome.errorCode}: ${outcome.message}\n`);
} else if (outcome.status === "aborted") {
  await savePlaygroundState(state);      // ← 中断也保存
  stderr.write("Run aborted.\n");
} else {
  await savePlaygroundState(state);      // ← 正常完成也保存
}
```

即每次你在 playground 中输入 prompt，**无论执行成功、失败还是中断**，都会触发保存。

### 2️⃣ 手动 `/save` 命令（第 204-205 行）

```typescript
if (command === "save") {
  const file = await savePlaygroundState(state);  // ← 用户手动保存
  stdout.write(`saved: ${file}\n`);
  return true;
}
```

### `savePlaygroundState` 函数的实际逻辑（第 249-256 行）

```typescript
async function savePlaygroundState(state: PlaygroundState) {
  await state.localStore.save({
    sessionId: "agent-core-playground",
    agentState: state.runtime.exportState(),     // 从 Runtime 导出完整会话状态
    sessionInfo: {
      cwd: state.cwd,
      modelId: state.runtime.snapshot().modelId
    }
  });
  return state.stateFile;
}
```

